
---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Experience | Causeway"
  description="Meet Krista Chapman, founder of Causeway Decision Quality Consultancy, and learn about the experience behind the work."
>
  <section class="experience section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">About the Founder</p>

      <h1>The Experience Behind the Work</h1>

      <div class="experience-intro">
        <div class="founder-photo">
          <img
            src="/causeway-founder-headshot.png"
            alt="Krista Chapman, founder of Causeway Decision Quality Consultancy."
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="experience-content">
          <p>
            Causeway was founded by Krista Chapman, whose perspective on
            organizational challenges has been shaped by experience at every
            level of complex organizations, from frontline healthcare to senior
            executive leadership.
          </p>

          <p>
            Beginning her career on the frontlines of healthcare, Krista
            developed a deep appreciation for the people, relationships, and
            systems that shape care partnerships. Over the past 15+ years, she
            has worked across clinical practice, operations, quality, and
            organizational leadership, bringing a practical, systems-level
            perspective to complex challenges.
          </p>

          <p>
            Krista understands the importance of bringing together the
            perspectives of people who shape, deliver, and experience services
            every day. She believes improvement happens when people are genuinely
            heard, different forms of expertise are valued, and decisions reflect
            the experiences of those most affected. It requires creating the
            conditions for open dialogue, shared understanding, and genuine
            partnership, while connecting organizational priorities with the
            realities of everyday practice and experience.
          </p>

          <p>
            Throughout her career, Krista has worked alongside executive teams,
            multidisciplinary groups, and frontline professionals across Canada
            and the United States. Her experience includes navigating complex
            operational environments, leading organizational improvement
            initiatives, advancing quality and performance, and helping
            organizations make sense of change. She remains actively engaged in
            the healthcare leadership community as a member of the Vancouver
            Island Chapter Executive of the Canadian College of Health Leaders.
          </p>

          <p>
            A registered nurse and Certified Health Executive (CHE), Krista also
            holds a Master of Precision Health (MPrecH) from the University of
            Calgary's Cumming School of Medicine. She brings together practical
            experience, systems-level thinking, evidence-informed decision-making,
            and an appreciation for the human side of organizational change.
          </p>

          <p>
            Through Causeway, Krista works alongside organizations and leaders
            to navigate complexity, uncover what matters, and find a clearer path
            forward.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .experience.section {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    padding: 100px 0 !important;
    margin: 0;
    background: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .experience .section-inner {
    width: 88%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .experience .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    color: #668A9A;
    font-size: 18px !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em !important;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .experience h1 {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 58px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 20px 0 55px;
    color: var(--slate);
  }

  .experience-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
    gap: clamp(45px, 7vw, 100px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .founder-photo {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .founder-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
  }

  .experience-content {
    max-width: 850px;
  }

  .experience-content p {
    margin: 0 0 26px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .experience.section {
      padding: 75px 0 !important;
    }

    .experience-intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 38px;
    }

    .founder-photo {
      max-width: 340px;
    }

    .experience h1 {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 550px) {
    .experience .section-inner {
      width: 88%;
    }

    .experience .eyebrow {
      font-size: 16px !important;
    }

    .founder-photo {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .founder-photo img {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    }

    .experience-content p {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>
